### Post Creation Tests for Multiple Media Uploads

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@authToken = YOUR_AUTH_TOKEN_HERE

### Test 1: Create post with text only (no media)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "desc": "This is a text-only post"
}

### Test 2: Create post with text and single image
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="desc"

Single image post test
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="media"; filename="test-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-image.jpg
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Test 3: Create post with text and multiple images
# Note: You'll need to use a tool like curl or Postman for this due to REST client limitations
# curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/ \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
#   -F "desc=Multiple images test" \
#   -F "media=@image1.jpg" \
#   -F "media=@image2.jpg" \
#   -F "media=@image3.jpg"

### Test 4: Create post with video
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="desc"

Video post test
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="media"; filename="test-video.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./test-video.mp4
------FormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Test 5: Get all posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Test 6: Get single post
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{postId}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Test 7: Test error - post with no text and no media
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "desc": ""
}

### Instructions for testing multiple files:
# Use curl or Postman for testing multiple file uploads:
#
# Single file:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/ \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
#   -F "desc=Single file test" \
#   -F "media=@image.jpg"
#
# Multiple files:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/ \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
#   -F "desc=Multiple files test" \
#   -F "media=@image1.jpg" \
#   -F "media=@image2.jpg" \
#   -F "media=@video.mp4"
